### 4. Services: `noteService.ts`

#### Note creation redirect

```diff
- if (!folderId || folder?.type === 'all' || folder?.type === 'trash' || folder?.type === 'system') {
+ if (!folderId || folder?.kind === 'trash' || folder?.kind === 'favorites') {
```

Home (`kind: 'home'`) allows note creation (notes go to `folderId: null`), so it's NOT redirected.

#### `getNotesForFolder()` — pass `kind` instead of `type`

```diff
- return this.tree.getNotesForFolder(folderId, folderType);
+ return this.tree.getNotesForFolder(folderId, folderKind);
```

---

### 5. Views: `noteListView.svelte.ts`

#### `canCreateNote()`

```diff
- return selectedFolder?.type !== 'trash' && selectedFolder?.type !== 'system';
+ return selectedFolder?.kind !== 'trash' && selectedFolder?.kind !== 'favorites';
```

Home allows creating notes. Trash and Favorites don't.

#### `getFilteredNotes()` — pass `kind` instead of `type`

```diff
- selectedFolder?.type
+ selectedFolder?.kind
```

