### 6. Tests

#### `folderSidebarView.test.ts`

All mock data changes from `type: 'system'` / `type: 'trash'` to `kind: 'favorites'` / `kind: 'home'` / `kind: 'trash'`. Test logic stays identical — only the mock data contract changes.

Mocks currently use `id: 'notes'` → update to `id: 'home'` to match the user's rename.

#### Other test files

`notes.test.ts`, `services.test.ts`, `folders.test.ts` — update any `type: 'trash'` / `type: 'system'` references to `kind:`.

