5. Update `noteService.ts` (`kind` instead of `type`)
6. Update `noteListView.svelte.ts` (`kind` instead of `type`)
7. Update `folderSidebarView.svelte.ts` (`resolveKind`, `resolveChildIds`, `buildSource`)
